SheRise – React Native Mobile Application

SheRise is a React Native mobile application focused on women empowerment.
The app demonstrates multi-screen navigation, clean UI, and real-world
mobile app structure.

🔹 Tech Stack:
- React Native
- JavaScript
- React Navigation

🔹 Features:
- Multiple screens
- User-friendly UI
- Form handling
- Scalable app structure

🔹 Use Case:
This project can be used as a base for:
- Student projects
- NGO or community apps
- MVP mobile applications

